				</Point>
			</Placemark>
			<Placemark>
				<name>Stewart, BC (Canada) and Hyder, Alaska</name>
				<description>We had a delightful couple of days exploring the glaciers and the bears in this area - and then Nancy somehow arranged for the US Post Office mail plane (a little float plane) to take us and our bikes over the mountains and Misty Fjords National Monument into Ketchikan, Alaska.</description>
				<LookAt>
					<longitude>-130.02804</longitude>
					<latitude>55.9147</latitude>
					<altitude>0</altitude>
					<range>19592.55532429537</range>
