			<Point>
				<coordinates>-110.9678206756044,31.32921915277344,0</coordinates>
			</Point>
		</Placemark>
		<Placemark>
			<name>Shakedown: Phoenix to Nogales</name>
			<description>After a couple of months off our bikes, and a lot of rework on the bikes, we wanted to test them (and ourselves out) first, so we started north of the border. We started out from here on January 29, 2007.</description>
			<LookAt>
